  </page_header>
  <text>
    <location value="30"/>
    <location value="48"/>
    <location value="454"/>
    <location value="128"/>
<![CDATA[Subsequently , we first evaluated PlantCAD2 on 12 comprehensive benchmarks using a zero-shot 103 strategy, demonstrating its efficiency and capacity to capture evolutionary conservation ( Table 1 ). 104 We  then  fine-tuned  the  model  on  seven  functional  genomics  tasks  including  chromatin 105 accessibility, gene expression, and protein abundance to further demonstrate its state-of-the-art 106 cross-species predictive ability ( Table 2 ). Together, these results highlight PlantCAD2's ability to 107 generalize  across  species  and  tasks,  and  to  serve  as  a  versatile  foundation  model  for  plant 108 genome interpretation. 109]]>  </text>
