<![CDATA[Figure 4. PlantCAD2 predicts functional impact of structural variants using zero-shot strategy. (A) ΔlogP calculation approach for deletion variants and phyloP score distribution for classification. (B) Scatter plot showing the positive correlation between PlantCAD2's ΔlogP scores and phyloP -based conservation scores. (C) AUROC performance distinguishes highly conserved from less conserved deletions.]]>    </caption>
