    <caption>
      <location value="60"/>
      <location value="260"/>
      <location value="454"/>
      <location value="313"/>
      Figure 6. PlantCAD2 predicts gene expression and translation across species. (A) Gene expression prediction pipeline using promoter and terminator sequences (1024 bp each) for binary classification and regression tasks. (B-C) Cross-species gene expression performance on maize NAM population for binary on/off prediction (B) and absolute expression levels (C). (D) Translation prediction pipeline using 500 bp upstream sequences. (E-F) Translation prediction performance trained on Arabidopsis and tested crossspecies on maize for binary on/off prediction (E) and absolute translation levels (F).
    </caption>
